sentences.text:
This writ petition is filed seeking for following reliefs:
(A) Issue a writ in nature of certiorari or any other appropriate writ or direction, to quash award dated 02.09.2021 passed by respondent no.2 as per Annexure-A in so far as petitioners land bearing Sy.no.127 measuring 1 acre 10 guntas of Cheelur Village, Maralavadi Hobli, Harohalli Taluk is concerned;
(B) Issue a writ in nature of mandamus or any other appropriate writ, order or direction and direct respondent no.3 to furnish report about veracity of grant of land in question in favour of petitioners' family by considering representation dated 03.10.2023 (Annexure- H);
